 - Access to project Wiki/Confluence;
 - Changes to mailing lists;
 - Enrolling onto team chats

[QA Engineer]
 - Access to project Wiki/Confluence;
 - Changes to mailing lists;
 - Enrolling onto team chats

[Sales] 
 - Access to project Wiki/Confluence;
 - Changes to mailing lists;
 - Enrolling onto team chats
 - Access to Billing/Invoicing Systems

[Support]
 - Access to knowledge bases;
 - Changes to mailing lists;
 - Enrolling onto team chats
 - Access to telephony and bugtracking systems
